    "image_prompt": "Editorial tech thumbnail 16:9: a grid of very different ad creatives (vertical video, product photo, carousel, testimonial card) feeding into a single funnel that points to many different people silhouettes, amber (#c8922a) accents on a dark background, retro pixel dot texture, hard 3px corners, solid offset pixel shadows, no text, no logos.",
    "faq_items": [
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "h3",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "What does creative is the new targeting mean?",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "It means that in Meta Ads the AI system does more and more of the targeting, and the content of the ad is the strongest signal you control over who sees it. You set the limits and the concepts; Advantage+ looks for the people who respond to each one.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "h3",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "How many creatives do I need per campaign?",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Meta doesn't publish a single number, and the 10-plus recommendations you'll see come from agencies and consultants. Distinct concepts matter more than volume: a small business can start with a few clearly different concepts and add more as results come in.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "h3",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Are custom audiences and lookalikes useless now?",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "They're still useful for excluding existing customers and as data for the system, especially if you upload customer lists and send conversions through the Conversions API. What lost weight is stacking interests to guess who your customer is.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
